            "review_title": "Review at Sen Pho",
            "review_text": "Edward Tran\n1 contribution\n0\nA perfect combination of food and culture\nDec 2019\nHiding inside a Cultural Center, this restaurant is a real gem. By combining Vietnamese Traditional food and Culture (Art, Architure), this place bring me to the difference level compare with other restaurants in Vietnam. Not classy, not expensive but friendly, cozy and enlightened.\nI highly recommend this gem to everyone who try to find a peaceful place to learn deeply about Vietnamese people, food and culture. You must try their soup with 6 different flavors and the jicama sticky rice.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 18, 2019",
